OL,3,GNEWSACharities praise will gifts
OL,4,Adespite cost of living
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who leave charities donations,
OL,7,Flegacies and bequests in their wills
OL,8,Fmake noticeable differences to
OL,9,Forganisations, no matter what the
OL,10,Famount is, sector leaders say.
OL,12,FThe comments come as one leader
OL,13,Facknowledged living costs could present
OL,14,F"affordability challenges" for
OL,15,Fpotential givers.
OL,17,FMarcus Liddiard, from the Association
OL,18,Fof Jersey Charities, said, despite "the
OL,19,Fnumber of people giving is very, very
OL,20,Fhigh compared to the UK", it was "hard
OL,21,Fto tell" how the cost of living might
OL,22,Faffect giving.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
