OL,3,GNEWSACharities praise will gifts
OL,4,Adespite cost of living
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of Jersey Fundraising Forum,
OL,7,FBethany Gallichan, said she understood
OL,8,Fsome people were struggling, but added
OL,9,Fany money left in wills could be
OL,10,F"transformational".
